  "notes": "No BACKED_UP_BY edges modeled: no operable backup system explicitly stated during the inoperability window; the affected penetration flow path was isolated manually rather than by an alternate system. Two distinct contributing failure modes (procedure not aligned with standards; packing not replaced since 2004) both feed into boric acid corrosion buildup per rule 5. Surveillance procedure imprecision noted in narrative as an additional detection-related factor but not modeled as a separate causal FailureMode since it did not directly cause the valve failure, only delayed discovery."
